# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What this repository ships
#
# The deployable application is webapp/ and nothing else. Everything below is
# kept on local disk and deliberately NOT committed, so that a hosting provider
# cloning this repository sees the application and not the analytics estate
# around it.
#
# IMPORTANT: ignoring these does not delete them. They remain on disk exactly
# as they are. It only stops git tracking them from here on.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Power BI projects -----------------------------------------------------
#
# The .pbip projects and their .Report / .SemanticModel folders are the source
# of truth for every DAX measure the application reads, so they matter - but
# they are an analytics artefact, not part of the deployed service, and they
# accounted for roughly 1,900 of the 2,100 files in this repository.
#
# THEY ARE NO LONGER BACKED UP BY THIS REPOSITORY. Keep them somewhere that is.
*.pbip
*.Report/
*.SemanticModel/

# Power BI local caches, which were already ignored and are regenerated.
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf

# --- Working spreadsheets and extracts --------------------------------------
#
# Root-level only, anchored with a leading slash: webapp/docs holds exported
# analysis datasets that are part of the documentation and must stay tracked.
/*.xlsx
/*.csv
/*.pdf

# --- Local tooling ----------------------------------------------------------
#
# Accumulated tool permissions, specific to one machine and one checkout, and
# containing local filesystem paths. Nothing here is needed to run the app.
/.claude/

# --- Backups ----------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Backups of the manually entered tables - they hold a mailbox refresh token.
/backups/
